---
import { site } from '../../data/site';
import Section from '../ui/Section.astro';
---

<Section>
	<div class="card flow">
		<h2 class="script">Registry</h2>
		<p>
			Your presence at our wedding is the greatest gift we could ever ask for! The time, effort, and
			expense you take to travel and celebrate with us is what we treasure most.
		</p>
		<p>
			Thanks to our wonderful parents, our kitchen and home are already fully stocked with the
			essentials (and maybe a few too many coffee mugs!). Because of this, our registry is on the
			smaller side and includes an option to contribute to our honeymoon fund. Contributions toward
			our honeymoon fund will help us fund our dream trip together as newlyweds!
		</p>
		<p>We are so grateful for your love and can't wait to celebrate with you soon!</p>
		<a href={site.registryUrl}>{site.couple.first} &amp; {site.couple.second}'s Registry</a>
	</div>
</Section>

<style>
	.card {
		max-width: 1014px;
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding: 40px clamp(20px, 5vw, 60px);
		border: 23px solid var(--color-olive);
		text-align: center;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
	}

	a {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: 1.375rem;
	}
</style>
